title: A record harvest in school gardens
date: 2026-09-30
author: Owen Price
excerpt: "Squash, beans and a lot of very proud children: the school gardens had their best year yet."
image: https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1529007328922-d323f83de273?w=1600&q=80
imageAlt: A child holding an armful of chard from a school garden
---

Twelve school gardens grew enough squash, beans and herbs for a harvest lunch at every school this autumn.

Next term, three more schools join the programme.
